<h3>Insurance Premium</h3>
<p>Most customers ask about the <strong>cost of movers and packers in mumbai</strong> and whether insurance is included. A basic coverage of ₹50 per kg is common, but comprehensive policies can rise to ₹200 per kg. Opting for full‑value protection is wise for valuable furniture, ensuring peace of mind against loss or damage.</p>
