      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to transport a car from Bhubaneswar to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To move a car between Bhubaneswar and Mumbai you need a valid registration certificate, insurance copy, a signed vehicle transport agreement, and a government‑issued e‑Way Bill. If the vehicle is under a corporate lease, include the authorization letter. All documents must match the driver’s ID and be presented at each state checkpost.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure the safety of fragile furniture during the Bhubaneswar‑to‑Mumbai shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer protective packaging system starts with high‑density bubble cushioning, followed by multi‑ply corrugated sheets, foam edge protectors, and stretch film. For delicate items we add custom wooden crates and anti‑vibration straps. Each package is sealed, labeled, and tracked via GPS, guaranteeing that every piece arrives intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why is IBA approval important when choosing packers and movers for Bhubaneswar to Mumbai relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The Indian Banks Association (IBA) approval means the mover complies with standardized financial and operational norms, ensuring transparent billing and reliable claim settlements. For Bhubaneswar to Mumbai furniture shifting, this accreditation helps you secure reimbursements from banks, PSU, or corporate accounts without disputes.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I monitor my shipment in real time during the Bhubaneswar‑to‑Mumbai journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container truck is equipped with satellite‑based GPS that streams live location updates to our client portal. You can view the exact position, estimated arrival time, and any checkpoint delays, giving you full visibility throughout the 1,770 km transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 100 % insurance coverage work if my goods get damaged en route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers the full declared value of each item. In the unlikely event of damage, you file a claim within 48 hours, provide photos and the original invoice, and our claims team processes reimbursement within ten business days, ensuring no financial loss.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical delivery timeline for a Bhubaneswar to Mumbai furniture shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the dedicated container trucks complete the 1,770 km journey in 4‑5 business days. This includes scheduled checkpost stops, loading/unloading time, and any necessary customs documentation for high‑value items. Our route performance highlights guarantee on‑time delivery for 96 % of shipments.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden fees I should be aware of when booking a Bhubaneswar‑to‑Mumbai move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden fees. Our cost matrix lists every charge upfront: base freight, packing materials, insurance premium, and optional services such as disassembly or extra crating. Taxes, tolls, and state levies are included in the quoted price, so the amount you see is the amount you pay.</p>
